== Usage ==

Place this infobox at the start of a monster page. All fields are optional,
and blank fields hide their rows.

<pre>
{{Mob
| family =
| type =
| job =
| gender =
| element =
| weakness =
| level =
| hp =
| mp =
| aggressive =
| notorious =
| harvest =
}}
</pre>

Blank values mean unknown, not zero. HP and MP are recorded for only some
monsters. Write <code>family</code> from family to subfamily to subspecies,
separating each with a slash.

Use <code>harvest</code> only to note an exception: 1.x monsters yield elemental
shards and crystals on defeat unless stated otherwise.

Put sightings by zone in a <code>== Locations ==</code> section below the
infobox. The locations table is separate from this template.
</noinclude>
